  {
    "id": 1014001030010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがとうございまーす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ファッション雑誌のモデルの仕事……\r\n甘奈なら大丈夫そうだな）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甘奈は普段から雑誌をよく見てるし、\r\nうんうん、ポーズもよくキマっている）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "よし、じゃあ今度はちょっと横向こうかー",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "はーい！　あっ……\r\nこんな感じですかー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "そうそう！　すごくいいよー",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ん？　甘奈……？）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "おっけーおっけー\r\n甘奈ちゃん、次は振り向く感じで！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あ……！　はーい！\r\n……こうですかー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "カメラマン",
    "text": "おーいいねー！\r\nばっちりだよ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甘奈の調子が少し……いや……気のせいか？）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "すみませーん！\r\nちょっと、休憩入りまーす！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（休憩……にしては、少し早くないか？）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
