  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈、どうかしたのか？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん、ちょっと集中できてなかった気がしてね\r\n休憩お願いしたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりそうか\r\nもしかして……悩み事か？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや\r\nないなら、それでいいんだが……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（勘違いだったか？）",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、よく気が付いたね\r\nさっすがー☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……実はね、甜花ちゃんのこと考えてたんだー\r\n今頃何してるかな～って気になっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、甜花のことを気にしていたんだな……",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃん、上手くやれてるかなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030080"
  },
  {
    "select": "心配することはないさ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "一度は挫けそうに\r\nなっていた",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "さすが姉妹だな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030090,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう言われても、心配になっちゃうんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花は上手くいかないときがあったって、\r\n乗り越えようと毎日頑張っているんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花の地道な努力はいつか、実を結ぶよ\r\n甜花は甜花にしかできない輝き方をしているんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃん、そんなに頑張ってるんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "（……あれ、じゃあ甘奈は……？）",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "（甜花ちゃんが頑張ってるのに、\r\n甘奈はこのままでいいの……？）",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈？\r\nどうした、いきなりぼーっとして",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何かあるなら聞くぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……ううん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんをやる気にさせるなんて、\r\nプロデューサーさんやるーって思ってたんだー",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nプロデューサーとして当然のことをしているだけだよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "またまた謙遜しちゃってー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なんていうか……甘奈も頑張らなくちゃいけないね\r\n甜花ちゃんもプロデューサーさんも、頑張っているんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈がそう言ってくれるとうれしいよ\r\n頑張っていこうな！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え……\r\n甘奈、そんなの聞いてないよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花は壁を乗り越え、アイドルを続けることを選んだんだ\r\n今は、少しでもアイドルとして輝けるように努力している",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nだから前より……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "（甜花ちゃん、きらきらしてるもんね……\r\n甘奈に相談してくれなかったのは寂しい、けど……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "良かった、プロデューサーさんがいてくれて\r\nこれからも甜花ちゃんのこと、お願いね？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、\r\nしっかりと見ていくぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、甘奈も同じだからな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、これからも\r\n甜花ちゃんと甘奈のこと、ちゃんと見ててよね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "（なんだか、甜花ちゃんに置いていかれちゃうような……\r\nううん、そんなことない。甘奈ももっと頑張らなきゃ！）",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030240,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え？　どういうこと？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花もな、甘奈のこといつも考えているんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんも……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、甜花は甘奈に追いつこうと頑張っている\r\nその頑張りが今、いい流れになりつつあるんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そっか、甜花ちゃんが甘奈のこと……\r\nえへ、うれしいな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんを引っ張っていけるように、\r\n甘奈も頑張るね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400103/1014001030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001030280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "（大丈夫。甜花ちゃんが甘奈から離れるなんて……\r\nないよね、きっと）",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
